  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 708.09 Site Access",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 708.09 Site Access.\n\n(a) WWTP access roads shall provide access to all delivery and loading points.\n\n(b) Roadway design and construction details shall be as required for the types of vehicles that will access the site and in accordance with local and state requirements.\n\n(c) Access to the site shall be controlled with a perimeter fence and lockable gate(s).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 700) #8590, eff 3-25-06; ss by #10693, eff 10-15-14; ss by #14258, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
